  "abstract": "We present a calculation of the coupling constants in the massive spin -1 \ufb01eld chiral Lagrangian to chiral O(p3) in the context of the extended Nambu\u2013Jona-Lasinio model described in Ref. [1]. Phenomenological applications of this Lag rangian to anomalous and non-anomalous low-energy hadronic transitions in volving spin-1 particles are also discussed. January 1993 CPT-93/P.2871",
